"<p>SaaSBase includes a curated marketplace of open-source services ready to be deployed with one click:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Supabase:</strong> Full BaaS suite with PostgreSQL, GoTrue Auth, Storage, and Studio.</li>\n<li><strong>PocketBase:</strong> Lightweight all-in-one Go backend with SQLite.</li>\n<li><strong>Appwrite:</strong> Complete backend solution for web &#x26; mobile apps.</li>\n<li><strong>n8n:</strong> Powerful workflow automation tool.</li>\n<li><strong>Umami &#x26; Plausible:</strong> Privacy-focused web analytics.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Deployment Flow</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Apps -> New App -> From Template</strong>.</li>\n<li>Choose your desired template.</li>\n<li>Configure your server destination, service name, and customizable environment variables.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Deploy</strong>. SaaSBase pulls the pinned container images, creates isolated volumes, configures Traefik routes, and runs health checks.</li>\n</ol>"